  "body": "Discover an exceptional standard of modern living in this beautifully crafted contemporary residence, where generous space, sophisticated design and effortless functionality come together.\r\nFeaturing five spacious bedrooms, each with its own private ensuite, and a total of 5.5 bathrooms, this impressive home is perfectly suited to large families, multi-generational living or those seeking an elevated lifestyle with room for everyone.\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, you will appreciate the thoughtfully designed layout, featuring a separate lounge and a guest bedroom with ensuite on the ground floor – ideal for extended family, visiting guests or those seeking additional privacy. A separate guest toilet adds further convenience.\r\nAt the heart of the home is a stunning designer kitchen, complemented by a fully equipped separate scullery, combining style with everyday practicality. The kitchen flows seamlessly into the dining area, while a striking feature fireplace creates an elegant division between the dining and main living spaces, adding warmth, character and ambience.\r\nDesigned for both relaxed family living and effortless entertaining, the two generous ground-floor living areas open onto an expansive outdoor deck, creating a seamless indoor-outdoor connection – perfect for hosting gatherings, enjoying summer evenings or simply unwinding with family and friends.\r\nUpstairs, four well-appointed ensuite bedrooms are complemented by an additional family lounge, providing a private retreat for family members. The luxurious master suite is particularly impressive, featuring its own private balcony – the perfect spot to enjoy a peaceful moment away from the everyday.\r\nLarge windows throughout much of the home invites an abundance of natural light, enhancing the sense of space and openness. The striking monochromatic exterior, clean architectural lines and sophisticated dark-toned kitchen cabinetry further complement the home's contemporary aesthetic.\r\nSet within the highly sought-after coastal community of Long Bay, this residence offers an enviable lifestyle, with the beautiful Long Bay Beach, Regional Park, scenic coastal walkways and Long Bay Village all within easy reach.\r\nFamilies will appreciate the range of local schooling options, while nearby cafés, restaurants, shopping and recreational amenities add to the convenience and appeal of this vibrant North Shore neighbourhood.\r\nMore than just a home, this is a place where space, comfort and contemporary elegance come together to create an exceptional family lifestyle.",
